@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-05  Manage another account access
' Requirements: ACC-11 ACC-12 ACC-18 ACC-19 PERM-01 PERM-04 REPORT-03 NOTICE-01 NOTICE-02 P-08
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Administrator" as A
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
actor "Affected user" as U
A -> S: Request target account action and reason where required
note over A,S
For reactivation, first verify current authorization.
Student reactivation needs a fresh enrollment check.
Role changes apply only among Faculty, Program Head,
and Administrator; no Student/staff conversion either way.
end note
alt Prohibited role transition, self-deactivation, own role change, or removing last active Administrator
  S --> A: Refuse action; keep existing account access
else Removing Faculty access while content is still owned
  S --> A: Require Program Head ownership transfer first
else Valid action with required verification complete
  S --> A: Confirm recorded action and administrative history
  S --> U: Email change and applicable reason
  note over S
  Deactivation and role change end existing sessions.
  Reactivation restores authorized access.
  Learning records remain saved.
  Administrator cannot edit academic outcomes.
  end note
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-05 | Product behavior
@enduml
